1. Improved logic flow with `if (!ClientManager.active || Time.frameCount % 20 == 0)` to avoid unnecessary processing.
2. Added comments to explain the purpose of each part of the script.
3. Fixed minor typos and formatting issues.
4. Ensured that the script is not overly complex and readable by breaking down the logic into smaller, more understandable sections.

